  "question": {
    "text": "An average person needs about <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math> energy per day. The amount of glucose (molar mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>) needed to meet this energy requirement is ______<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br />(Use : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>&nbsp;(glucose)<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2700</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "667",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> mole glucose give <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2700</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math> energy so mole of glucose needed for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math> energy<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10000</mn><mn>2700</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7037</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>moles</mi></math><br />wt. of glucose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7037</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>180</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>666</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>666</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>667</mn><mi>gm</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
